=== VERDICT BATTERY (goal #101 item 4) seed=42 reps=1 2026-08-21T17:32:53Z
CONTRACT goal-gate "THE (q, refresh) SWEEP -- PRE-REGISTRATION", and nothing else. Paper 16.78 is the derivation.
CELLS c1   (c1/c7/sc2 are the THREE STABLE cells and carry the verdict; c8 is the LOSS-HEAVY WITNESS cell and carries none -- its [SUCC] orig p50 has 3.20x rep dispersion, so its cell-scaled point is derived from an input the successor-arrival pass recorded NOT USABLE. c8L is not run at all: 52x.)
ARMS-MEANING CTL = the shipped machine, both gates ABSENT, byte-identical; R2Q86 = the STRONGEST MEASURED CHALLENGER (c7-R2Q86 s configuration) at each cell s own 16.78.3 grid point
ARMS  CTL R2Q86   (paired within rep, ARMS INNERMOST)
ARMENV CTL q=unset n_req=-
ARMENV R2Q86 q=0.864 n_req=74
AXIS1 RWM_HOLDDOWN_Q, ABSENT by default; GARBAGE and any q outside (0,1) resolve back to ABSENT and print unset
AXIS2 RWM_REFRESH_FLOOR_US = F in (2*srtt).clamp(F, 4F); ABSENT => F = HOLE_NACK_REFRESH_MIN = 25 ms and the engine is BYTE-IDENTICAL. R=4 is the SHIPPED clamp's own aspect ratio, not a new constant.
GRID  the TRANSCRIBED (cell, arm) -> F / delivered-cadence table (paper 16.78.3); the DELIVERED CADENCE is the treatment, F is only its input:
GRID  c1 selfheal_p50_us=24600 shipped_floor_us=25000 band=[147,294] paths=1
GRID  c1-CTL F=unset cadence_want_us=25000 | env="RWM_DELTA_CAP=1 RWM_SUM_CAP=1 RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS=0 RWM_RACK_CLOCKS=0 RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP=0 RWM_COMPOSED_CAP=0 RWM_THREE_TERM=0 RWM_STORE_CAP_UNIFIED=0 RWM_LATE_BRAKE=0 RWM_CHARGE_RECOVERY=0 RWM_RELEASE_1TO1=0 RWM_LOSS_SENT_TRUTH=0 RWM_RTT_DUMP=0 RWM_SUCC_DUMP=0"
GRID  c1-R2Q86 F=12300 cadence_want_us=12300 | env="RWM_HOLDDOWN_Q=0.864 RWM_REFRESH_FLOOR_US=12300 RWM_DELTA_CAP=1 RWM_SUM_CAP=1 RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS=0 RWM_RACK_CLOCKS=0 RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP=0 RWM_COMPOSED_CAP=0 RWM_THREE_TERM=0 RWM_STORE_CAP_UNIFIED=0 RWM_LATE_BRAKE=0 RWM_CHARGE_RECOVERY=0 RWM_RELEASE_1TO1=0 RWM_LOSS_SENT_TRUTH=0 RWM_RTT_DUMP=0 RWM_SUCC_DUMP=0"
F1    THE WIRING WITNESS, SCORED FIRST: the CADENCE lines. below=1 iff [QCLK] site=receiver w_us_max < the cell's shipped effective floor. It is a RESULT line and NEVER an abort -- if F1 fires every other clause is VOID and this row names the next cadence in the chain.
TIMER the SHIPPED [25,100] ms clamp is the SENDER's timer on EVERY row: RWM_QUANTILE_CLOCKS/RWM_RACK_CLOCKS/RWM_DERIVED_SWEEP are CONTAMINATION gates and RWM_W_FORM must resolve cantelli
F3    a delivered cadence below TAIL_SWEEP_MIN_US = 25 ms puts the RECEIVER's report clock AHEAD of the SENDER's backstop for the first time in this engine's history -- a stated confound on the sub-floor arms, carried on every reading taken from them
RPD   the wiring test statistic, CROSS-ENDPOINT: [FCAUSE] n (sender) / [SUCC] det (receiver)
ARM-VOID (law_n=0) is a RESULT and never an abort
BANDSCOPE the goodput abort bands apply to CTL ONLY (band_applies=1); an out-of-band TREATMENT reading is a RESULT -- it is 16.78.4's P-B
